{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1782350778219,"sessionID":"ses_103a00a69ffeXsNQ2547CvZLOb","part":{"id":"prt_efc628f66001lmkLQ9i2AYug1G","messageID":"msg_efc62879a001EU2r5YBc5i1ebP","sessionID":"ses_103a00a69ffeXsNQ2547CvZLOb","snapshot":"6de719b83d10874f9fbb1eff2820a8c17d2d7156","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1782350784424,"sessionID":"ses_103a00a69ffeXsNQ2547CvZLOb","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"write_26","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"/*\n * Brazilian Soccer MCP Server - Data Repository\n *\n * Holds the loaded match and player datasets in memory for fast querying.\n */\nusing BrazilianSoccerMcp.Models;\n\nnamespace BrazilianSoccerMcp.Data;\n\npublic sealed class DataRepository\n{\n    private readonly Lazy<IReadOnlyList<MatchRecord>> _matches;\n    private readonly Lazy<IReadOnlyList<PlayerRecord>> _players;\n\n    public IReadOnlyList<MatchRecord> Matches => _matches.Value;\n    public IReadOnlyList<PlayerRecord> Players => _players.Value;\n\n    public DataRepository(string dataDirectory)\n    {\n        var loader = new CsvLoader();\n        _matches = new Lazy<IReadOnlyList<MatchRecord>>(() => loader.LoadMatches(dataDirectory));\n        _players = new Lazy<IReadOnlyList<PlayerRecord>>(() => loader.LoadPlayers(dataDirectory));\n    }\n}\n","filePath":"/private/var/folders/t6/p1v727892_qc9xqqdzq2rpym0000gn/T/retort-local-tjpsd7_l/retort-fab0f22fd4e0/src/Data/DataRepository.cs"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/private/var/folders/t6/p1v727892_qc9xqqdzq2rpym0000gn/T/retort-local-tjpsd7_l/retort-fab0f22fd4e0/src/Data/DataRepository.cs","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"src/Data/DataRepository.cs","time":{"start":1782350784417,"end":1782350784423}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Now create the DataRepository to hold loaded data and the QueryEngine.\n\nThe QueryEngine will have methods for:\n- FindMatches(team, season, competition, dateFrom, dateTo)\n- GetTeamStatistics(team, season, competition, homeOnly, awayOnly)\n- GetHeadToHead(teamA, teamB)\n- SearchPlayers(name, nationality, club, position, minOverall)\n- GetTopPlayers(nationality, club, position, count)\n- GetCompetitionStandings(season, competition)\n- GetBiggestWins(competition, count)\n- GetAverageGoals(competition)\n- GetBestAwayRecord(competition, season)\n- GetTeamCompetitions(team)\n\nI need to be careful with nullable types and normalization.\n\nLet me write DataRepository first.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_efc629925001iQRLcZJBCxKRFE","sessionID":"ses_103a00a69ffeXsNQ2547CvZLOb","messageID":"msg_efc62879a001EU2r5YBc5i1ebP"}}
