{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1782351011968,"sessionID":"ses_103a00a69ffeXsNQ2547CvZLOb","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"read_45","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/t6/p1v727892_qc9xqqdzq2rpym0000gn/T/retort-local-tjpsd7_l/retort-fab0f22fd4e0/src/Queries/ResponseFormatter.cs"},"output":"<path>/private/var/folders/t6/p1v727892_qc9xqqdzq2rpym0000gn/T/retort-local-tjpsd7_l/retort-fab0f22fd4e0/src/Queries/ResponseFormatter.cs</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: /*\n2:  * Brazilian Soccer MCP Server - Response Formatter\n3:  *\n4:  * Converts query results into the human-readable formats shown in the\n5:  * specification (standings, head-to-head, team records, player lists, etc.).\n6:  */\n7: using BrazilianSoccerMcp.Models;\n8: \n9: namespace BrazilianSoccerMcp.Queries;\n10: \n11: public static class ResponseFormatter\n12: {\n13:     public static string FormatMatch(MatchRecord m)\n14:     {\n15:         var date = m.Date?.ToString(\"yyyy-MM-dd\") ?? \"Unknown date\";\n16:         var home = m.HomeTeam;\n17:         var away = m.AwayTeam;\n18:         var score = m.HomeGoals.HasValue && m.AwayGoals.HasValue\n19:             ? $\"{m.HomeGoals}-{m.AwayGoals}\"\n20:             : \"?-?\";\n21:         var extra = string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(m.Round)\n22:             ? (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(m.Stage) ? string.Empty : $\" {m.Stage}\")\n23:             : $\" Round {m.Round}\";\n24:         return $\"{date}: {home} {score} {away} ({m.Competition}{extra})\";\n25:     }\n26: \n27:     public static string FormatMatches(string title, IEnumerable<MatchRecord> matches)\n28:     {\n29:         var list = matches.ToList();\n30:         if (list.Count == 0) return $\"No matches found for: {title}\";\n31: \n32:         var lines = new List<string> { title };\n33:         lines.AddRange(list.Select(m => $\"- {FormatMatch(m)}\"));\n34:         return string.Join(\"\\n\", lines);\n35:     }\n36: \n37:     public static string FormatTeamStatistics(TeamStatistics stats)\n38:     {\n39:         return $\"\"\"{stats.Team} record:\n40: - Matches: {stats.Matches}\n41: - Wins: {stats.Wins}, Draws: {stats.Draws}, Losses: {stats.Losses}\n42: - Goals For: {stats.GoalsFor}, Goals Against: {stats.GoalsAgainst}\n43: - Points: {stats.Points}\n44: - Win rate: {stats.WinRate:P1}\"\"\";\n45:     }\n46: \n47:     public static string FormatHeadToHead(HeadToHeadRecord h2h)\n48:     {\n49:         return $\"\"\"{h2h.TeamA} vs {h2h.TeamB} head-to-head:\n50: - Matches: {h2h.Matches}\n51: - {h2h.TeamA} wins: {h2h.TeamAWins}\n52: - {h2h.TeamB} wins: {h2h.TeamBWins}\n53: - Draws: {h2h.Draws}\n54: - {h2h.TeamA} goals: {h2h.TeamAGoals}\n55: - {h2h.TeamB} goals: {h2h.TeamBGoals}\"\"\";\n56:     }\n57: \n58:     public static string FormatStandings(int season, string competition, IReadOnlyList<StandingRow> standings)\n59:     {\n60:         if (standings.Count == 0)\n61:             return $\"No standings available for {competition} {season}.\";\n62: \n63:         var lines = new List<string> { $\"{season} {competition} Final Standings (calculated from matches):\" };\n64:         int rank = 1;\n65:         foreach (var row in standings)\n66:         {\n67:             var suffix = rank == 1 ? \" - Champion\" : string.Empty;\n68:             lines.Add($\"{rank}. {row.Team} - {row.Points} pts ({row.Wins}W, {row.Draws}D, {row.Losses}L){suffix}\");\n69:             rank++;\n70:         }\n71:         return string.Join(\"\\n\", lines);\n72:     }\n73: \n74:     public static string FormatPlayers(string title, IEnumerable<PlayerRecord> players)\n75:     {\n76:         var list = players.ToList();\n77:         if (list.Count == 0) return $\"No players found for: {title}\";\n78: \n79:         var lines = new List<string> { title };\n80:         int rank = 1;\n81:         foreach (var p in list)\n82:         {\n83:             lines.Add($\"{rank}. {p.Name} - Overall: {p.Overall}, Position: {p.Position}, Club: {p.Club}\");\n84:             rank++;\n85:         }\n86:         return string.Join(\"\\n\", lines);\n87:     }\n88: \n89:     public static string FormatBiggestWins(IEnumerable<MatchRecord> matches)\n90:     {\n91:         var list = matches.ToList();\n92:         if (list.Count == 0) return \"No decisive matches found.\";\n93: \n94:         var lines = new List<string> { \"Biggest victories:\" };\n95:         int rank = 1;\n96:         foreach (var m in list)\n97:         {\n98:             lines.Add($\"{rank}. {FormatMatch(m)}\");\n99:             rank++;\n100:         }\n101:         return string.Join(\"\\n\", lines);\n102:     }\n103: \n104:     public static string FormatAverageGoals(double avg, string? competition = null)\n105:     {\n106:         var label = string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(competition) ? \"all competitions\" : competition;\n107:         return $\"Average goals per match ({label}): {avg:F2}\";\n108:     }\n109: }\n\n(End of file - total 109 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"/*\n * Brazilian Soccer MCP Server - Response Formatter\n *\n * Converts query results into the human-readable formats shown in the\n * specification (standings, head-to-head, team records, player lists, etc.).\n */\nusing BrazilianSoccerMcp.Models;\n\nnamespace BrazilianSoccerMcp.Queries;\n\npublic static class ResponseFormatter\n{\n    public static string FormatMatch(MatchRecord m)\n    {\n        var date = m.Date?.ToString(\"yyyy-MM-dd\") ?? \"Unknown date\";\n        var home = m.HomeTeam;\n        var away = m.AwayTeam;\n        var score = m.HomeGoals.HasValue && m.AwayGoals.HasValue\n            ? $\"{m.HomeGoals}-{m.AwayGoals}\"\n            : \"?-?\";","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/private/var/folders/t6/p1v727892_qc9xqqdzq2rpym0000gn/T/retort-local-tjpsd7_l/retort-fab0f22fd4e0/src/Queries/ResponseFormatter.cs","text":"/*\n * Brazilian Soccer MCP Server - Response Formatter\n *\n * Converts query results into the human-readable formats shown in the\n * specification (standings, head-to-head, team records, player lists, etc.).\n */\nusing BrazilianSoccerMcp.Models;\n\nnamespace BrazilianSoccerMcp.Queries;\n\npublic static class ResponseFormatter\n{\n    public static string FormatMatch(MatchRecord m)\n    {\n        var date = m.Date?.ToString(\"yyyy-MM-dd\") ?? \"Unknown date\";\n        var home = m.HomeTeam;\n        var away = m.AwayTeam;\n        var score = m.HomeGoals.HasValue && m.AwayGoals.HasValue\n            ? $\"{m.HomeGoals}-{m.AwayGoals}\"\n            : \"?-?\";\n        var extra = string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(m.Round)\n            ? (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(m.Stage) ? string.Empty : $\" {m.Stage}\")\n            : $\" Round {m.Round}\";\n        return $\"{date}: {home} {score} {away} ({m.Competition}{extra})\";\n    }\n\n    public static string FormatMatches(string title, IEnumerable<MatchRecord> matches)\n    {\n        var list = matches.ToList();\n        if (list.Count == 0) return $\"No matches found for: {title}\";\n\n        var lines = new List<string> { title };\n        lines.AddRange(list.Select(m => $\"- {FormatMatch(m)}\"));\n        return string.Join(\"\\n\", lines);\n    }\n\n    public static string FormatTeamStatistics(TeamStatistics stats)\n    {\n        return $\"\"\"{stats.Team} record:\n- Matches: {stats.Matches}\n- Wins: {stats.Wins}, Draws: {stats.Draws}, Losses: {stats.Losses}\n- Goals For: {stats.GoalsFor}, Goals Against: {stats.GoalsAgainst}\n- Points: {stats.Points}\n- Win rate: {stats.WinRate:P1}\"\"\";\n    }\n\n    public static string FormatHeadToHead(HeadToHeadRecord h2h)\n    {\n        return $\"\"\"{h2h.TeamA} vs {h2h.TeamB} head-to-head:\n- Matches: {h2h.Matches}\n- {h2h.TeamA} wins: {h2h.TeamAWins}\n- {h2h.TeamB} wins: {h2h.TeamBWins}\n- Draws: {h2h.Draws}\n- {h2h.TeamA} goals: {h2h.TeamAGoals}\n- {h2h.TeamB} goals: {h2h.TeamBGoals}\"\"\";\n    }\n\n    public static string FormatStandings(int season, string competition, IReadOnlyList<StandingRow> standings)\n    {\n        if (standings.Count == 0)\n            return $\"No standings available for {competition} {season}.\";\n\n        var lines = new List<string> { $\"{season} {competition} Final Standings (calculated from matches):\" };\n        int rank = 1;\n        foreach (var row in standings)\n        {\n            var suffix = rank == 1 ? \" - Champion\" : string.Empty;\n            lines.Add($\"{rank}. {row.Team} - {row.Points} pts ({row.Wins}W, {row.Draws}D, {row.Losses}L){suffix}\");\n            rank++;\n        }\n        return string.Join(\"\\n\", lines);\n    }\n\n    public static string FormatPlayers(string title, IEnumerable<PlayerRecord> players)\n    {\n        var list = players.ToList();\n        if (list.Count == 0) return $\"No players found for: {title}\";\n\n        var lines = new List<string> { title };\n        int rank = 1;\n        foreach (var p in list)\n        {\n            lines.Add($\"{rank}. {p.Name} - Overall: {p.Overall}, Position: {p.Position}, Club: {p.Club}\");\n            rank++;\n        }\n        return string.Join(\"\\n\", lines);\n    }\n\n    public static string FormatBiggestWins(IEnumerable<MatchRecord> matches)\n    {\n        var list = matches.ToList();\n        if (list.Count == 0) return \"No decisive matches found.\";\n\n        var lines = new List<string> { \"Biggest victories:\" };\n        int rank = 1;\n        foreach (var m in list)\n        {\n            lines.Add($\"{rank}. {FormatMatch(m)}\");\n            rank++;\n        }\n        return string.Join(\"\\n\", lines);\n    }\n\n    public static string FormatAverageGoals(double avg, string? competition = null)\n    {\n        var label = string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(competition) ? \"all competitions\" : competition;\n        return $\"Average goals per match ({label}): {avg:F2}\";\n    }\n}","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":109,"totalLines":109,"truncated":false}},"title":"src/Queries/ResponseFormatter.cs","time":{"start":1782351011962,"end":1782351011967}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Good, the HOME workaround worked. But now I have raw string literal issues in ResponseFormatter.cs. The problem is that I used `\"\"\"...\"\"\"` raw string literals but the strings contain quotes and the formatting is wrong. Let me read the file and fix it.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_efc661c5a001Zy0tLgIN08CGX3","sessionID":"ses_103a00a69ffeXsNQ2547CvZLOb","messageID":"msg_efc66030e001uSzWeFlPwLh3YB"}}
