{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1782351352739,"sessionID":"ses_103a00a69ffeXsNQ2547CvZLOb","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"write_76","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"/*\n * Brazilian Soccer MCP Server - BDD Style Tests\n *\n * xUnit tests written in a Given/When/Then style that verify the core\n * query capabilities against the provided Kaggle datasets.\n */\nusing BrazilianSoccerMcp.Data;\nusing BrazilianSoccerMcp.Queries;\n\nnamespace BrazilianSoccerMcp.Tests;\n\npublic sealed class DataFixture : IDisposable\n{\n    public DataRepository Repository { get; }\n    public QueryEngine Engine { get; }\n\n    public DataFixture()\n    {\n        var dataDirectory = ResolveDataDirectory();\n        Repository = new DataRepository(dataDirectory);\n        Engine = new QueryEngine(Repository);\n    }\n\n    public void Dispose() { }\n\n    private static string ResolveDataDirectory()\n    {\n        var outputData = Path.Combine(AppContext.BaseDirectory, \"data\", \"kaggle\");\n        if (Directory.Exists(outputData)) return outputData;\n\n        var repoData = Path.Combine(Directory.GetCurrentDirectory(), \"..\", \"data\", \"kaggle\");\n        if (Directory.Exists(repoData)) return Path.GetFullPath(repoData);\n\n        throw new DirectoryNotFoundException(\"Could not locate data/kaggle directory for tests.\");\n    }\n}\n\npublic abstract class QueryTestBase : IClassFixture<DataFixture>\n{\n    protected DataFixture Fixture { get; }\n    protected QueryEngine Engine => Fixture.Engine;\n\n    protected QueryTestBase(DataFixture fixture)\n    {\n        Fixture = fixture;\n    }\n}\n","filePath":"/private/var/folders/t6/p1v727892_qc9xqqdzq2rpym0000gn/T/retort-local-tjpsd7_l/retort-fab0f22fd4e0/tests/DataFixture.cs"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/private/var/folders/t6/p1v727892_qc9xqqdzq2rpym0000gn/T/retort-local-tjpsd7_l/retort-fab0f22fd4e0/tests/DataFixture.cs","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"tests/DataFixture.cs","time":{"start":1782351352736,"end":1782351352738}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Now create BDD-style tests. The TASK.md mentions BDD Gherkin scenarios. I'll write xUnit tests that follow the Given/When/Then pattern with descriptive names.\n\nTests should cover:\n- Match queries (find matches between teams, by season, by competition)\n- Team statistics\n- Head-to-head\n- Player queries\n- Competition standings\n- Normalization\n\nI should use the actual data from data/kaggle for tests. Since the test project copies data files, I can resolve the data directory similarly.\n\nLet me create a test fixture that loads the DataRepository once for all tests to avoid reloading.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_efc6b368a001tr1EZn1AlVPFTL","sessionID":"ses_103a00a69ffeXsNQ2547CvZLOb","messageID":"msg_efc6b216f0015qDBUmbipW6YzK"}}
